<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian dollar well based - RBA's Fraser.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian dollar well based - RBA's Fraser.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian dollar is well based on fundamental rather than speculative factors and has not needed support from Reserve Bank intervention in the market to influence the exchange rate, retiring Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) governor Bernie Fraser said.</p>
<p>Fraser made these same comments in a speech last week.</p>
</text>
